<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.00 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.97 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.32 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Sales		   42.47 vs  51.49</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.15 vs   9.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.24 vs  10.46</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.91 vs  17.33</p>
<p> Sales		  333.00 vs 381.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Budimex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
